      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "Known gap, and it predates this move",
      "prov:value": "**This move does not fix that** — it is a role-graph\nbinding, not a location — and it is recorded here rather than left in a sidecar\nbecause a finding nobody reads is a finding nobody fixes.",
